From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Danil Somsikov <dsv@chromium.org>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 03:52:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 39/48] DevTools: only inherit frontend host from local
 frontend openers

When a DevTools window is opened by another window, require every live
opener in the original opener chain to be a local DevTools frontend
before creating a DevToolsFrontendHost for the new window. Also keep
is_local_frontend_ sticky-false once a WebContents has loaded a
non-local frontend, and reject renderer-initiated navigations without a
live opener chain unless the window already had a frontend host.

Bug: 553152519
Change-Id: I403a9a3520db747f392020f3055ae0385eb9765e
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8538408
Commit-Queue: Danil Somsikov <dsv@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Benedikt Meurer <bmeurer@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1715425}
